TEXT 16 640 Left 2 ;Original TIDL ADCMP580 characterization bench. Not a vendor example copy.
TEXT 16 672 Left 2 ;Latch compare-mode: LE=0.4V, _LE=GND, VTT=GND (verified vs installed ADI ADCMP580.asc).
TEXT 16 704 Left 2 ;HYS left open = datasheet zero hysteresis. VTP and VTN to GND = internal 50ohm used.
TEXT 16 736 Left 2 ;CML Q and QB each 50ohm to GND. No extra 50ohm shunt on VP. Overdrive is pin-referred.
TEXT 16 768 Left 2 ;Vth/Vod/Amp are engineering testbench parameters, not challenge 1 PPS evidence.
TEXT 16 816 Left 2 !.param Vth=0 Vod=0.05 Pol=1 Td=200p
TEXT 16 848 Left 2 !.param Slew=5e9 Amp=0.4 Tr={2*Vod/Slew}
TEXT 16 880 Left 2 !.param Vstart={Vth-Pol*Vod} Vstop={Vth+Pol*Vod}
TEXT 16 912 Left 2 !.param Tstop={Td+Tr+2n}
TEXT 16 944 Left 2 !.tran 0 {Tstop}
TEXT 16 976 Left 2 !.options plotwinsize=0 numdgt=10
TEXT 16 1008 Left 2 !.meas TRAN t_in WHEN V(VP)-V(VN)=0 CROSS=1
TEXT 16 1040 Left 2 !.meas TRAN t_out WHEN V(Q)-V(QB)=0 CROSS=1
TEXT 16 1072 Left 2 !.meas TRAN tpd PARAM t_out-t_in
TEXT 16 1104 Left 2 !.meas TRAN vout_max MAX V(Q)-V(QB)
TEXT 16 1136 Left 2 !.meas TRAN vout_min MIN V(Q)-V(QB)
TEXT 16 1168 Left 2 !.meas TRAN t_q_lo WHEN V(Q)-V(QB)=-0.24 CROSS=1
TEXT 16 1200 Left 2 !.meas TRAN t_q_hi WHEN V(Q)-V(QB)=0.24 CROSS=1
TEXT 16 1232 Left 2 !.meas TRAN t_r_out PARAM abs(t_q_hi-t_q_lo)
